WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:08.960
Hi, I'm Theresa. I own Monty's in Birchington.

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:13.280
We're taking part in Fiver Fest for&nbsp;
the second time. We had a great time&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:20.400
taking part last October and won the best&nbsp;
individual effort award from Totally Locally.

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:27.200
This time round we're hoping to repeat our&nbsp;
massive bargain of five pound sacks of potatoes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:31.920
and also a brilliant health food&nbsp;
bag full of goodies for a fiver.

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:35.600
We want to encourage loads of people to&nbsp;
come and discover the shops that they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:38.560
don't realize are on their local high street, so&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:43.840
if you haven't taken a stroll down Station&nbsp;
Road in a while please come and see us.

